DispatchOpen
Request
Action
Resource
Payload
Result

capability dispatch-capability

dispatch:
  ?request shape Request
  ?action shape Action
  ?resource shape Resource
  ?payload shape Payload
  ?result shape Result
  ?request:
    dispatches ?action to ?resource with ?payload yielding: ?result

mode dispatch given request action resource payload yields result: many
  reactive while DispatchOpen
  continues linearly
  effect action resource resource payload payload requires dispatch-capability
